  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for mbedtls",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for mbedtls fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in mbedtls:\n\n- Update to version 3.6.7:\n  * CVE-2026-25832: TLS 1.3 client accepted HRR selecting unadvertised\n    group (boo#1280186)\n  * Fix TLS 1.3 clients to reject a HelloRetryRequest whose selected\n    group was not advertised in the original ClientHello\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
